WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Goal: choose natural pronouns and everyday vocabulary in Madrid vs Bogotá without stereotypes. Plural address: Spain distinguishes informal «vosotros tenéis» from formal «ustedes tienen»; Colombia uses «ustedes tienen» in every plural context.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:27.800
Everyday lexical false friends within Spanish: in Colombia «un tinto» is a black coffee (not red wine, «vino tinto»), and «coger/tomar el autobús» varies by region.

3
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:35.000
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
